    "text": "By Tyler Scott ,\n4 hours ago SPARTANBURG COUNTY, S.C. (FOX Carolina) - The Spartanburg County Sheriff’s Office said a multi-vehicle crash has damaged a power pole on Thursday. Deputies said the wreck took place on East Blackstock Road near Paradise Lanes. All lanes were closed after the crash until the pole was cleared from the roadway at 8:20 p.m. Read full article\n1",
